### 2026-10-02 | After the rain
@setting: media/scene-2026-10-02.json

The river path was silver with puddles this morning. I stopped at the park bench beneath the big tree and put my tea mug on the seat while I tied my boot. Across the water a little boat nudged its rope against the landing, making a soft wooden knock.

Back home, the kitchen window held a blurred reflection of the lamp and the notebook. I kept a picture study beside the writing so I could remember the colors, rather than trying to find the perfect name for gray. #walks #home @river

![Demo illustration of a rainy window, a tea mug and a pot of leaves](media/window.png)

