### 2026-10-05 | The raised bed
@setting: media/scene-2026-10-05.json

Sun caught the edges of the garden flowers before it reached the wooden bench. Robin and I knelt beside the raised bed, planting three little seedlings under the apple tree. I left the watering can by the path and sat on the bench with my notebook until the soil on my gloves dried.

I made a small digital model to keep the shape of the bed, with a marker for the first seedling. The model is its own attached object; the day's scene also comes from these sentences. #garden #making @garden

