### 2026-10-06 | A note drawn by hand
@setting: media/scene-2026-10-06.json
@hand: script10
@ink: green

At the desk I pushed the lamp closer and opened my notebook to a blank page. A sprig of garden flowers stood in an old mug beside the window. I tried drawing the curve of the stem without lifting the pencil, then laughed at how much it looked like a winding river.

The attached ink sample has a picture for reading and a companion file for its pen strokes. It is a demonstration drawing, rather than a scan of my notebook. The words here use a different pen and green ink. #drawing #making @desk

