### 2026-10-08 | Listening at the window

Rain drummed on the kitchen window all afternoon. I kept the lamp on above the wooden table, moved the notebook away from a drip, and watched the garden tree shake its branches. The tea mug made a tiny round clearing in the crumbs from lunch.

I wanted sound and movement beside this entry as well as words. These attached clips are generated demo recordings, not audio or video captured during a real day. They stay quiet until I press play. #home #listening @kitchen

