### 2026-10-10 | A strip of sea

We walked down to the beach in the clear morning light. A blue boat rested above the waterline, a wooden bench faced the sea, and a small tree leaned away from the wind. I sat on the bench with a notebook and tried to draw the horizon without making it slope uphill.

Robin bought bread from the station kiosk on the way back. We ate it at the café table, leaving a little fan of crumbs between the tea mugs. [Yesterday's train](#train-arrival) already felt much further away than one day. #travel #drawing @beach

