### 2026-10-11 | Colors on the desk

Back at home, the desk was exactly as I had left it: lamp tilted down, notebook open and a dry leaf beside the tea mug. I set up the easel by the window and painted the garden tree in three colors. The sky changed before the paint had even dried.

I kept [lamp yellow]{ink=#9d6b16}, [river blue]{highlight=#b9dbe5 highlight-style=brush}, and [leaf green]{underline=#527744} beside the picture. The [faint pencil shade]{highlight=#e3d8bd highlight-style=pencil} is less certain, which suits the afternoon. #drawing #making @desk

