### 2026-10-12 | A longer way home

I took the river path instead of the direct road home. The park bench under the tree had a perfect square of sunlight on one end. A person on a bicycle rang their bell, then disappeared behind the flowers beside the bridge.

At the kitchen table I opened the notebook next to a mug of tea and wrote down the distance from this made-up week. A line across the days tells me where the numbers came from; it doesn't tell me which walk mattered most. #walks @river

