### 2026-10-13 | Music downstairs

The café had moved a small piano beside the window. Robin played a slow scale while I sat at the wooden table with my notebook and tea mug. The lamp on the piano made a golden line along the keys; the garden flowers in the counter vase were starting to dry.

Listened to [Abbey Road](spotify:album:0ETFjACtuP2ADo6LFhL6HN) later, and liked the change from piano keys to a whole room of sound. The album reference records what this fictional narrator wrote, without loading a player or attaching the album. #music #friends @cafe

