### 2026-10-14 | A film, then tea

Rain darkened the window as I put the last loaf of bread beside the oven. The kitchen lamp reflected in the tea mug, and the notebook lay open at a list of films Robin had mentioned. I moved everything to the little table and stayed there for the evening.

Watched [The Matrix](imdb:tt0133093), then wrote about the color of its corridors rather than trying to explain the whole story. Reading [Pride and Prejudice](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL66554W) before bed made a funny change of pace. #watching #reading @home

#### Other titles in the notebook

- Watching [Severance](https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/44933/severance).
