### 2026-10-18 | The small campsite

By evening the tent was up beneath a tree near the river. Robin set a lamp on the wooden bench while I unwrapped the bread and apples on our little camp table. A small fire glowed in the stone ring, with the blue boat pulled up safely on the bank beyond it.

When it grew dark we carried tea mugs to the bench and stopped talking for a while. The tent looked very bright from outside, although there was only one light in it. I wrote two lines in the notebook and put it away. #outside #friends @camp

-> A small circle of light was enough. <-

