### 2026-10-21 | The lamp stayed on

The desk lamp was on before the sky had quite turned dark. I opened the notebook beside a mug of tea and watched rain collect along the bottom of the window. The tree in the garden looked much thinner than it had on [the first morning](#2026-10-01).

I read [the note about the clay bowl](#clay-note) and liked that it still sounded unfinished. Then I closed the book, moved the mug to the kitchen table, and made a list of things that could stay exactly where they were. #home #making @desk

> Some days leave a picture rather than a lesson.

