### 2026-10-22 | The bicycle bell

I wheeled the bicycle down to the park bench beside the river. A fallen branch from the tree had caught in the flowers, and the path was patched with wet leaves. I put the notebook on the bench and tightened the little screw under the bell until it rang clearly again.

The ride home was short and slow. At the café I leaned the bicycle below the window and carried a tea mug out to the small table by the door. I had fixed a sound, which seemed a nice thing to have done. #mending #walks @park

