### 2026-10-23 | Names by the window

Robin had already found a café table by the window when I arrived. Two tea mugs stood beside a little vase of flowers, and the lamp behind the counter was reflected twice in the glass. I took the notebook out, then put it away again because the conversation was moving faster than my pencil.

