### 2026-10-26 | Before the sentences

Rain ran down the kitchen window while I sat with the tea mug between both hands. The notebook lay open under the lamp, with a sketch of the garden tree taking up most of the page. I jotted a few rough words before I knew what I wanted to say.

Later I wrote this paragraph underneath. The rough version can stay in the scratchpad without appearing on the finished page. It is still in the journal file, so I would review it before sharing. #home #writing @kitchen

