### 2026-10-27 | A guitar in the corner

Robin brought a guitar to the café and set it beside the piano under the lamp. We found a table close to the window, put our tea mugs on opposite sides of my notebook, and tried to remember a tune neither of us knew all the way through. The flowers on the counter were new, bright yellow this time.

Played [Minecraft](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q49740) after dinner, mostly tending the garden. The real work and the imaginary work somehow felt like different kinds of rest. #music #games #friends @cafe

