### 2026-10-28 | Questions in the garden

The garden bench was covered in leaves from the apple tree. I brushed off a space for my notebook and tea mug, then checked the seedlings in the raised bed. The flowers along the path looked smaller in the low afternoon sun, as if the whole garden had settled back into itself.

I looked at the open tasks in this journal before deciding what to do next. The shelf can wait. The borrowed key cannot stay in my coat pocket forever. #garden #making @garden

