### 2026-10-30 | Everyone brought something

The kitchen table was too small for all the bread, apples and tea mugs, so we moved the notebook and lamp to the window ledge. Robin put flowers in the clay bowl, which was finally dry. Outside, the garden tree was bare enough to show the blue evening sky between every branch.

We ate slowly and talked about the [train trip](#2026-10-09), the [campfire](#2026-10-18), and the [guitar tune](#2026-10-27) we still had not finished. I left the washing up until everyone had gone home. #food #friends @kitchen

o 18:30 Dinner at home #friends

